WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.528 --> 00:00:07.176
Looking younger is something every wedding parent wants from their makeup.

2
00:00:07.512 --> 00:00:12.648
Rule number one of wedding-parent makeup is: "make her look younger, never older."

3
00:00:12.984 --> 00:00:16.392
There are two key points to achieving that.

4
00:00:16.728 --> 00:00:22.008
First, creating youthful, glowing skin while also contouring the facial structure.

5
00:00:22.344 --> 00:00:28.776
An artist experienced with mature faces understands midlife bone structure and muscle tone, lifting sagging facial lines,

6
00:00:29.112 --> 00:00:34.944
and using lifting techniques to fine-tune uneven or asymmetrical eyes for a more vibrant look.

7
00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:39.936
Second, using a personal color diagnosis to find the shades that truly suit you.

8
00:00:40.272 --> 00:00:49.176
Finding the colors that brighten your complexion most and applying them to both makeup and hanbok can take ten years off — no surgery required.

9
00:00:49.512 --> 00:00:52.296
Color choice matters enormously in makeup.

10
00:00:52.632 --> 00:00:58.824
With the right personal colors and skilled contouring, you can look years younger as a wedding parent.
